### FlowLens API — Faz 4
###
### Calistir (repo kokunden, parametresiz):
###   dotnet run --project src/FlowLens.Api -c Release
###
### graph.json su sirayla aranir: (a) --FlowLens:GraphPath ile verilen yol, (b) calisma dizini,
### (c) AppContext.BaseDirectory'den yukari dogru, FlowLens.slnx/.git gorulunce dur.
### (c) gerekli cunku `dotnet run --project` calisma dizinini PROJE klasorune alir.
###
### Baska bir grafigi hedeflemek icin:
###   dotnet run --project src/FlowLens.Api -c Release -- --FlowLens:GraphPath=<yol>\graph.json
###
### Hangi dosyanin okundugu /graph/stats -> graphFilePath alaninda gorunur.
###
### Node id'leri bosluk, /, :, {} ve <> tasiyor; hepsi query string'de yuzde kodlamasiyla gecer.
### Path segmenti kullanilmiyor: Kestrel path icindeki %2F'yi varsayilan olarak reddeder.

@host = http://localhost:5100

### 1 — Endpoint listesi (opsiyonel modul filtresi)
GET {{host}}/endpoints?module=Ordering

### 2 — Forward: bu endpoint neye dokunuyor  (tablolar + kolonlar + R/W)
GET {{host}}/trace?node=POST%20%2Fapi%2Fordering%2Fcheckout

### 3 — Backward: bu tabloya kim dokunuyor  (kokler, RootKind'a gore gruplu)
GET {{host}}/backward?node=table%3Aordering.orders

### 4 — Tablo katalogu (erisim TUM graph uzerinden)
GET {{host}}/tables

### 5 — Graph durumu, diagnostics ve duran sinirlar
GET {{host}}/graph/stats


### --- Parametreler ---

### Utility node'lari goster (varsayilan gizli; her cevap kac tane gizledigini yazar)
GET {{host}}/trace?node=POST%20%2Fapi%2Fordering%2Fcheckout&includeUtility=true

### Sig derinlik -> truncated: true + "truncated" limitation'i
GET {{host}}/trace?node=POST%20%2Fapi%2Fordering%2Fcheckout&maxDepth=2

### Route yerine node id de kabul
GET {{host}}/trace?node=endpoint%3APOST%20%2Fapi%2Fordering%2Fcheckout

### Bir kolona kim yaziyor
GET {{host}}/backward?node=column%3Aordering.orders.Status


### --- Hata yollari ---

### 400: aralik disi derinlik. Sessizce kirpilmaz - istenen deger, sinir ve olculen
### en uzun zincir birlikte doner.
GET {{host}}/trace?node=POST%20%2Fapi%2Fordering%2Fcheckout&maxDepth=51

### 404: eslesmeyen node -> bos liste degil, "didYouMean" onerileri
GET {{host}}/trace?node=POST%20%2Fapi%2Fordering%2Fchekout

### 503: graph yoksa/bozuksa. Govde dosya yolunu, sebebi ve tam komutu tasir.
### /graph/stats bu durumda da 200 doner ve status: "unavailable" der.
GET {{host}}/endpoints


### --- curl karsiliklari ---
###
### curl "http://localhost:5100/endpoints?module=Ordering"
### curl "http://localhost:5100/trace?node=POST%20%2Fapi%2Fordering%2Fcheckout"
### curl "http://localhost:5100/backward?node=table%3Aordering.orders"
### curl "http://localhost:5100/tables"
### curl "http://localhost:5100/graph/stats"
